---
import ServiceLayout from '../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';

const schemaData = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "GEO Agency for Preschools Singapore",
    "description": "GEO and AI search optimisation agency for preschools and childcare centres in Singapore. Get your centre named when parents ask ChatGPT, Gemini and Google AI Mode about preschools near them.",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Jraft Creative",
      "url": "https://jraftcreative.com/",
      "logo": "https://jraftcreative.com/images/logo.png",
      "telephone": "+6582234578",
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "streetAddress": "60 Paya Lebar Road, Paya Lebar Square",
        "postalCode": "409051",
        "addressLocality": "Singapore",
        "addressCountry": "SG"
      }
    },
    "areaServed": { "@type": "Country", "name": "Singapore" },
    "serviceType": "Preschool AI Search Optimisation"
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What is GEO for a preschool?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Generative Engine Optimisation is the work of getting your centre named when a parent asks an AI assistant instead of searching Google. Ask ChatGPT for a good preschool near Punggol for a three-year-old and you get two or three names, not a page of results. GEO is about being one of those names, which depends on signals traditional SEO largely ignores." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What do AI assistants use to judge a preschool?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Concrete, checkable facts: which levels you take, your curriculum approach, operating hours, licensing status, and exactly which neighbourhood each centre sits in. Vague positioning like 'nurturing environment for every child' cannot be matched to a parent asking about half-day N2 places in a specific estate, so it gets skipped in favour of a centre that states it plainly." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Does our curriculum approach matter for this?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "It matters a great deal, because parents increasingly ask by approach — Montessori, Reggio-inspired, play-based, bilingual immersion. If your approach is described only in brochure language and never stated as a clear attribute of your programme, an assistant has no basis to surface you when a parent asks for that specific thing." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "We run several centres. How does that affect AI visibility?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Multi-centre operators are usually the worst affected, because all the branches sit behind one address and one description. A parent asking about your actual neighbourhood gets told about a competitor. Each centre needs its own distinct entity — location, levels offered, hours — before an assistant can recommend the right one." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is it too early for preschools to worry about AI search?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "It is early, which is why it is worth doing now. Very few Singapore preschools have structured any of this, so the bar is far lower than in Google search where the anchor operators have spent years building authority. Centres that establish clean data early are the ones assistants keep naming as more parents start asking this way." } }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://jraftcreative.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "GEO Agency for Preschools Singapore", "item": "https://jraftcreative.com/preschool-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/" }
    ]
  }
];
---

<style is:global>
  /* Hide the global background grid pattern on this page only */
  .animated-bg__grid { display: none; }

  /* More-prominent related-service pills — match challenge-card-v2 green treatment */
  #related-services .related-service-link {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.14) 0%, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.06) 100%), rgba(20, 28, 32, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.35);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }
  #related-services .related-service-link:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.22) 0%, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.1) 100%), rgba(20, 28, 32, 0.7);
    border-color: rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.6);
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.3);
  }

  /* Separate the CTA section from related-services with bg-alt */
  .service-cta-section {
    background: var(--bg-alt) !important;
  }

  /* Enrolment Funnel — 5-stage horizontal flow with green accents */
  .renovation-funnel {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 56px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 48px;
    counter-reset: funnel;
  }
  .funnel-stage {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 28px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.14) 0%, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.06) 100%), rgba(20, 28, 32, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.28);
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .funnel-stage:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.55);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -16px rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.3);
  }
  .funnel-stage h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .funnel-stage p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .funnel-stage:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    right: -34px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    z-index: 2;
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .renovation-funnel {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .funnel-stage:nth-child(2n)::after,
    .funnel-stage:last-child::after {
      display: none;
    }
    .funnel-stage:nth-child(2n-1)::after {
      right: -22px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .renovation-funnel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .funnel-stage::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<ServiceLayout
  title="GEO Agency for Preschools Singapore"
  description="GEO agency for preschools and childcare centres in Singapore — get named when parents ask ChatGPT and Gemini about preschools near them."
  canonical="https://jraftcreative.com/preschool-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/"
  ogTitle="GEO Agency for Preschools Singapore"
  ogDescription="AI search optimisation for Singapore preschools and childcare centres. Get named when parents ask ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity."
  ogImage="https://jraftcreative.com/images/og-webdev.jpg"
  keywords="geo agency for preschools, preschool ai search optimisation singapore, ai search optimisation for preschools, childcare centre chatgpt optimisation, generative engine optimisation preschool singapore, Jraft Creative"
  schemaData={schemaData}
  heroLabel="GEO Agency for Preschools"
  heroTitle='GEO Agency for <span class="highlight">Preschools in Singapore</span>'
  heroSubtitle="A parent expecting their first child now asks an AI which preschools are worth looking at near them. The answer names two or three centres. Everything after that — the tour, the waitlist, the decision — happens inside that shortlist."
  heroImage="/images/service-preschool.webp"
  heroImageAlt="Preschool classroom in Singapore — preschool AI search optimisation"
  heroButtons={[
    { text: "Get an AI Visibility Audit", href: "/contact/", class: "btn btn-primary" },
    { text: "See Preschool SEO", href: "/preschool-seo-singapore/", class: "btn btn-secondary" }
  ]}
  whatsappText="Hi Jraft Creative, I'd like to know if my preschool shows up in AI search."
  ctaLabel="Be the Answer"
  ctaTitle="Find Out What AI Says About Your Preschool"
  ctaDescription="Book a free consultation and we'll run the questions a real parent would ask — by level, curriculum approach and neighbourhood — across ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity, and show you where each of your centres currently stands. We'll get back to you within 24 hours."
  ctaButtons={[
    { text: "Get an AI Visibility Audit", href: "/contact/", class: "btn btn-primary" },
    { text: "Chat on WhatsApp", href: "https://wa.me/6582234578?text=Hi%20Jraft%20Creative%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20know%20if%20my%20preschool%20shows%20up%20in%20AI%20search.", class: "btn btn-secondary" }
  ]}
  hideDefaultCta={false}
>

  <!-- ========== THE CHALLENGE ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="challenge" aria-label="AI search challenges for preschools in Singapore">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">The Challenge</p>
        <h2>The Shortlist Now Forms <span class="highlight">Before</span> a Parent Ever <span class="highlight">Calls You</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal">
        <p>Preschool is a high-stakes, high-research decision — and the first filter has quietly moved to an AI assistant.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-details-grid challenge-grid-v2" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));">
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Warmth Doesn't Compute</h3>
            <p>"A nurturing environment where every child thrives" can't be matched to a parent asking about half-day N2 places in Punggol. It reads well and surfaces nothing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Branches Hidden Behind One Address</h3>
            <p>Multi-centre operators usually publish one location and one description. Ask about a neighbourhood you actually serve and the assistant names someone else.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d3">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Curriculum Buried in Brochure Language</h3>
            <p>Parents now ask by approach — Montessori, Reggio-inspired, bilingual. If yours is never stated as a plain attribute, it can't be retrieved.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== WHAT WE DELIVER ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="sub-services" style="background: var(--bg-alt);" aria-label="GEO services for preschools">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">What We Deliver</p>
        <h2>Six <span class="highlight">GEO Workstreams</span> for <span class="highlight">Preschools</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal">
        <p>We turn what makes your centre a good fit into facts a machine can retrieve — then track whether it starts naming you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-details-grid deliver-grid">
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d1" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-seo-audit.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>AI Visibility Audit</h3>
            <p>We ask what parents ask, across ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity, and record whether your centres appear and how they're described.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d2" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-onpage-seo.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Level &amp; Programme Entities</h3>
            <p>Infant care, playgroup, nursery and kindergarten levels stated as structured facts — including hours, age ranges and half or full day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d3" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-local-seo.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Per-Centre Location Data</h3>
            <p>Every branch gets its own entity and profile, so a neighbourhood question returns the centre a parent can actually walk to.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d1" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-content-strategy.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Curriculum &amp; Approach Clarity</h3>
            <p>Your pedagogy stated plainly enough to be retrieved when a parent asks for that specific approach, not just admired once they arrive.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d2" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-ai.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Licensing &amp; Trust Signals</h3>
            <p>Registration details, tenure and accreditations corroborated across your site, profiles and directories — the checks a cautious parent makes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d3" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-campaign-analytics.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Prompt Monitoring by Centre</h3>
            <p>Tracked prompts per branch and level, re-run monthly, so you can see visibility per centre rather than as one blurred average.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== WHY US ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="why-us" aria-label="Why choose Jraft Creative as your preschool GEO agency">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Why Jraft Creative</p>
        <h2>A <span class="highlight">GEO Agency</span> That Has Been <span class="highlight">Cited Itself</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal">
        <p>We run this on our own site and publish the method rather than treating it as a black box.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-details-grid challenge-grid-v2" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));">
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>We've Earned AI Citations</h3>
            <p>We wrote up <a href="/blog/how-we-got-cited-in-google-ai-overview-singapore/">how we got cited in Google's AI Overview</a> for niche Singapore queries — method, not marketing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>We Already Run Preschool Search</h3>
            <p>We handle <a href="/preschool-seo-singapore/">preschool SEO</a> and <a href="/preschool-marketing-singapore/">marketing</a> for centres here, so we know which parent questions precede a tour booking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d3">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Measured, Not Claimed</h3>
            <p>Baseline first, monthly re-runs after. If a centre's visibility hasn't moved, the report says so — see our <a href="/education-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/">education GEO programme</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== ENROLMENT FUNNEL ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="buyer-funnel" style="background: var(--bg-alt);" aria-label="Where AI search fits the preschool parent journey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">The Enrolment Funnel</p>
        <h2>Where <span class="highlight">AI Search</span> Fits the <span class="highlight">Parent Journey</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <p>Preschool decisions run months ahead of the start date, and the shortlist forms early. AI now sits at the very front — before the tour, before the waitlist, before you know the family exists.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="renovation-funnel reveal">
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Ask</h3>
          <p>A parent asks which preschools suit their child</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Shortlist</h3>
          <p>Two or three centres get named — or you don't</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Validate</h3>
          <p>They check licensing, curriculum and reviews</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Tour</h3>
          <p>The shortlist becomes a booked centre visit</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Enrol</h3>
          <p>Place accepted, then years of word of mouth</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== FAQ ========== -->
  <section class="section faq-section" id="faq" style="background: var(--bg-alt);" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about GEO for preschools">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">FAQ</p>
        <h2>GEO for <span class="highlight">Preschools</span> — Questions Answered</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d1">
          <summary>What is GEO for a preschool?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Generative Engine Optimisation is the work of getting your centre named when a parent asks an AI assistant instead of searching Google. Ask ChatGPT for a good preschool near Punggol for a three-year-old and you get two or three names, not a page of results. GEO is about being one of those names, which depends on signals traditional SEO largely ignores.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d2">
          <summary>What do AI assistants use to judge a preschool?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Concrete, checkable facts: which levels you take, your curriculum approach, operating hours, licensing status, and exactly which neighbourhood each centre sits in. Vague positioning like "nurturing environment for every child" can't be matched to a parent asking about half-day N2 places in a specific estate, so it gets skipped in favour of a centre that states it plainly.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d3">
          <summary>Does our curriculum approach matter for this?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>It matters a great deal, because parents increasingly ask by approach — Montessori, Reggio-inspired, play-based, bilingual immersion. If your approach is described only in brochure language and never stated as a clear attribute of your programme, an assistant has no basis to surface you when a parent asks for that specific thing.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d1">
          <summary>We run several centres. How does that affect AI visibility?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Multi-centre operators are usually the worst affected, because all the branches sit behind one address and one description. A parent asking about your actual neighbourhood gets told about a competitor. Each centre needs its own distinct entity — location, levels offered, hours — before an assistant can recommend the right one.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d2">
          <summary>Is it too early for preschools to worry about AI search?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>It's early, which is why it's worth doing now. Very few Singapore preschools have structured any of this, so the bar is far lower than in Google search where the anchor operators have spent years building authority. Centres that establish clean data early are the ones assistants keep naming as more parents start asking this way.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related Services -->
  <section class="section" id="related-services" aria-label="Related services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Explore More</p>
        <h2>More <span class="highlight">Preschool</span> Services</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="related-services-grid reveal">
          <a href="/preschool-seo-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Preschool SEO</a>
          <a href="/preschool-website-design-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Preschool Website Design</a>
          <a href="/preschool-advertising-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Preschool Advertising</a>
          <a href="/preschool-social-media-marketing-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Preschool Social Media</a>
          <a href="/preschool-branding-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Preschool Branding</a>
          <a href="/preschool-marketing-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Full-Service Preschool Marketing</a>
          <a href="/education-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Education GEO / AI Search</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServiceLayout>
